All four agents are done: **58 entries** in total (13 + 18 + 17 + 10).

Next I'll run a mechanical check across the folder:
- the frontmatter fields are all present;
- nothing is marked `proven`;
- every entry has a "When NOT to apply" section;
- no wikilink points to a missing file;
- entry counts per lesson, for `_book.md`.

